    {
      "text": "Index address read 2420 S Winchester; the city case PLN-2024-29 is at 2400 S Winchester Blvd on the VTA station property. The city moved this case to its inactive list and shows it as Project Closed, last updated 2024-12-05. The city's data does not say how it was decided.",
