      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City case PLN-2024-29 is a Zoning Clearance (Housing Development Project): 90 units in a single 6-story, approximately 138,000 square-foot building with two levels of above-ground parking and four residential levels, plus transit plaza improvements.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001551"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "VTA lists land use entitlements approved 2024-08-15; its March 2026 fact sheet shows financing and city permits 2024-2027 and construction 2027-2029; its June 2026 placemat shows phase Project Financing and anticipated completion 2028.",
